---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import franchises from '../../data/franchises.json';
import { teams } from '../lib/teams';
const cards=franchises.map((f:any)=>{const lineage=teams.filter((t:any)=>t.franchiseId===f.franchiseId);const current=lineage.find((t:any)=>t.teamId===f.activeTeamId);return{id:f.franchiseId,name:current?.name??`Franchise ${f.franchiseId}`};});
---
<BaseLayout title="Head to Head | AMD FFL">
<main>
<section class="page-head"><div class="shell"><div class="eyebrow">Settle it with receipts</div><h1>Head to Head</h1><p>Pick two franchises. Twenty seasons of grudges, beatdowns, heartbreak, and inconvenient facts will do the rest.</p></div></section>
<section class="shell matchup">
<div class="picker"><label>FRANCHISE ONE<select id="team-a">{cards.map((c:any)=><option value={c.id}>{c.name}</option>)}</select></label><div class="versus">VS</div><label>FRANCHISE TWO<select id="team-b">{cards.map((c:any)=><option value={c.id} selected={c.id===2}>{c.name}</option>)}</select></label></div>
<div class="coming"><div class="eyebrow">THE RECEIPTS ARE COMING</div><h2>Rivalry Engine</h2><p>The original Head-2-Head archive lived in two externally published Google Sheets. The WordPress export preserved the sheet references, but not their cells. This page is ready for that matchup data without inventing a single result.</p><div class="planned"><span>OVERALL SERIES</span><span>POINTS SCORED</span><span>PLAYOFF MEETINGS</span><span>BIGGEST BEATDOWN</span><span>CLOSEST GAME</span><span>WIN STREAK</span></div></div>
<div class="callout"><strong>Some rivalries are competitive.</strong><span>Others are just recurring appointments with disappointment.</span></div>
</section>
</main>
<style>
.page-head{background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,rgba(213,169,70,.12),transparent 34%);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.page-head p{max-width:760px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.65}.matchup{padding:42px 0 70px}.picker{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 1fr;gap:18px;align-items:end;padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(145deg,#171c22,#101419);border-radius:10px}.picker label{display:grid;gap:10px;color:var(--accent);font-size:.65rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em}.picker select{width:100%;padding:15px 16px;border:1px solid #343d47;border-radius:6px;background:#0b1015;color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:1rem;font-weight:800}.versus{display:grid;place-items:center;height:51px;color:#77828e;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:900}.coming{margin-top:18px;padding:38px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:#11161b;text-align:center}.coming h2{margin:7px 0 10px;font-size:2.6rem;text-transform:uppercase}.coming p{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}.planned{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;margin-top:30px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line)}.planned span{padding:18px 10px;background:#0d1217;color:#8f9aa5;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em}.callout{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px;padding:20px 24px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);background:#12171c}.callout strong{color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase}.callout span{color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:700px){.picker{grid-template-columns:1fr}.versus{height:auto}.planned{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.callout{display:block}.callout span{display:block;margin-top:7px}}
</style>
</BaseLayout>